msgid "# Installation"
msgstr "# 安装"

msgid ""
"This guide prepares the host and software environment for the Quickstart."
msgstr "本指南负责把 Host 和软件环境准备到可以进入 Quickstart 的状态。"

msgid ""
"If you have already set up the Ascend driver/firmware, Docker, and a pre-"
"built image environment and only want to run your first model, go directly "
"to the [Quickstart](quick_start.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果你的 Ascend driver/firmware、Docker 和预构建镜像环境已经准备好，并且只想快速运行第一个模型，可以直接前往 "
"[快速开始](quick_start.md)。"

msgid "## 1. Identify Your Hardware {: #installation-hardware }"
msgstr "## 1. 确认你的硬件 {: #installation-hardware }"

msgid ""
"You do not need to understand internal chip codenames during installation. "
"Choose the documentation path below based primarily on the actual product "
"name."
msgstr "安装过程不要求用户理解内部芯片代号；优先按实际产品名称选择后续文档路径。"

msgid "| Installation/Quickstart path | Typical products |"
msgstr "| 安装/Quickstart 路径 | 典型产品 |"

msgid ""
"| Atlas A2 | Atlas 800T A2, Atlas 900 A2 PoD, Atlas 200T A2 Box16, Atlas "
"300T A2, Atlas 800I A2, and others |"
msgstr ""
"| Atlas A2 | Atlas 800T A2、Atlas 900 A2 PoD、Atlas 200T A2 Box16、Atlas 300T "
"A2、Atlas 800I A2 等 |"

msgid ""
"| Atlas A3 | Atlas 800T A3, Atlas 900 A3 SuperPoD, Atlas 9000 A3 SuperPoD, "
"Atlas 800I A3, and others |"
msgstr ""
"| Atlas A3 | Atlas 800T A3、Atlas 900 A3 SuperPoD、Atlas 9000 A3 "
"SuperPoD、Atlas 800I A3 等 |"

msgid "| Atlas 300I DUO | Atlas 300I DUO inference card |"
msgstr "| Atlas 300I DUO | Atlas 300I DUO inference card |"

msgid "| Atlas 200I Pro | Atlas 200I Pro inference card |"
msgstr "| Atlas 200I Pro | Atlas 200I Pro inference card |"

msgid "| Atlas 950DT | Atlas 950DT inference products |"
msgstr "| Atlas 950DT | Atlas 950DT inference products |"

msgid "??? tip \"Not sure which hardware category to choose?\""
msgstr "??? tip \"不确定自己应该选择哪类硬件？\""

msgid ""
"Do not determine the product type solely from the number of `/dev/davinci*` "
"devices or the chip codename."
msgstr "不要只根据 `/dev/davinci*` 数量或芯片代号判断产品类型。"

msgid "Check the following first:"
msgstr "优先检查："

msgid ""
"- the server or accelerator card nameplate;\n"
"    - procurement records and device model;\n"
"    - official product pages and hardware documentation."
msgstr ""
"- 服务器或加速卡铭牌；\n"
"    - 采购记录和设备型号；\n"
"    - 官方产品页面和硬件说明。"

msgid "For reference, see:"
msgstr "可以参考："

msgid ""
"- [Ascend product overview](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/AscendFAQ/ProduTech/productform/hardwaredesc_0001.html)\n"
"    - [Atlas 800I A2](https://e.huawei.com/cn/products/computing/ascend/atlas-800i-a2)\n"
"    - [Atlas 300I DUO](https://e.huawei.com/cn/products/computing/ascend/atlas-300i-duo)\n"
"    - [Ascend hardware](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/ai-server/)"
msgstr ""
"- [Ascend product overview](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/AscendFAQ/ProduTech/productform/hardwaredesc_0001.html)\n"
"    - [Atlas 800I A2](https://e.huawei.com/cn/products/computing/ascend/atlas-800i-a2)\n"
"    - [Atlas 300I DUO](https://e.huawei.com/cn/products/computing/ascend/atlas-300i-duo)\n"
"    - [Ascend hardware](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/ai-server/)"

msgid "## 2. Check the Host Environment {: #installation-host }"
msgstr "## 2. 检查 Host 环境 {: #installation-host }"

msgid ""
"Whether you use a pre-built image, an existing CANN environment, or a source"
" installation, the host must first have a working Ascend driver/firmware."
msgstr "无论使用预构建镜像、已有 CANN 环境还是源码安装，Host 都必须先具备可用的 Ascend driver/firmware。"

msgid "First, run:"
msgstr "首先运行："

msgid "Verify that:"
msgstr "应满足："

msgid ""
"- the operating system is Linux;\n"
"- `npu-smi info` lists the target NPU;\n"
"- the target NPU reports a healthy status."
msgstr ""
"- 操作系统为 Linux；\n"
"- `npu-smi info` 能看到目标 NPU；\n"
"- 目标 NPU health 状态正常。"

msgid "If you plan to use Docker, also run:"
msgstr "如果准备使用 Docker，再运行："

msgid "The command should display the Docker version and print:"
msgstr "应输出 Docker 版本，并打印："

msgid ""
"### 2.1 Troubleshoot Host Check Failures {: #installation-host-"
"troubleshooting }"
msgstr "### 2.1 Host 检查失败时 {: #installation-host-troubleshooting }"

msgid "??? tip \"`npu-smi` is missing or cannot detect the device\""
msgstr "??? tip \"`npu-smi` 不存在或无法看到设备\""

msgid ""
"Check the management utility, driver information, and device nodes on the "
"host:"
msgstr "检查 Host 上的管理工具、driver 信息和 device node："

msgid ""
"If `npu-smi`, the driver information, or device nodes are missing, fix the "
"host driver/firmware before installing vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"如果 `npu-smi`、driver 信息或 device node 缺失，应先修复 Host driver/firmware，\n"
"    而不是继续安装 vLLM Ascend。"

msgid ""
"Refer to the official Huawei installation documentation for the "
"driver/firmware installation and upgrade sequence."
msgstr "Driver/firmware 的安装和升级顺序请参考 Huawei 官方安装文档。"

msgid "??? tip \"Docker is inaccessible\""
msgstr "??? tip \"Docker 无法访问\""

msgid ""
"If Docker is not installed, follow the\n"
"    [official Docker Engine installation guide](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/)\n"
"    for your Linux distribution."
msgstr ""
"如果还没有安装 Docker，请按照\n"
"    [Docker Engine 官方安装指南](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/)\n"
"    选择对应的 Linux 发行版完成安装。"

msgid ""
"If Docker is already installed, first verify that the Docker daemon is "
"running:"
msgstr "已安装 Docker 时，先确认 Docker daemon 正常运行："

msgid ""
"If the current user does not have permission to access the daemon, configure"
" Docker user permissions according to your system security policy, or use an"
" administrator-approved method to run Docker."
msgstr ""
"如果当前用户无权限访问 daemon，请根据系统安全策略配置 Docker 用户权限，\n"
"    或使用管理员允许的运行方式。"

msgid "??? tip \"Docker images cannot be downloaded\""
msgstr "??? tip \"Docker 镜像无法下载\""

msgid ""
"`docker pull` is initiated by the Docker daemon. The daemon does not "
"necessarily use the shell's `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY` settings."
msgstr ""
"`docker pull` 由 Docker daemon 发起。Shell 的 `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY`\n"
"    不一定会被 Docker daemon 使用。"

msgid ""
"Configure an organization-approved registry mirror or Docker daemon proxy."
msgstr "请配置组织允许的 registry mirror 或 Docker daemon proxy。"

msgid "## 3. Confirm Software Compatibility {: #installation-release-stack }"
msgstr "## 3. 确认软件配套 {: #installation-release-stack }"

msgid ""
"This installation page and the Quickstart use the same release baseline:"
msgstr "本安装页与 Quickstart 使用同一套发布基线："

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/software_stack.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/software_stack.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "!!! important \"Choose the complete version set before installation\""
msgstr "!!! important \"先确定整套版本，再开始安装\""

msgid ""
"CANN, PyTorch/TorchNPU, Triton Ascend, vLLM, and vLLM Ascend must be used in a compatible combination.\n"
"    Before installing a different release, consult the project's\n"
"    [release compatibility matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix),\n"
"    rather than upgrading only one component."
msgstr ""
"CANN、PyTorch/TorchNPU、Triton Ascend、vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 必须使用兼容组合。\n"
"    安装其他发布版本时，请先查看项目维护的\n"
"    [Release compatibility matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix)，\n"
"    不要只升级其中一个组件。"

msgid "## 4. Choose an Installation Method {: #installation-methods }"
msgstr "## 4. 选择安装方式 {: #installation-methods }"

msgid ""
"Choose one complete path based on your current environment. Do not mix "
"individual steps from different paths."
msgstr "推荐根据当前环境选择一条完整路径，不要混合不同路径中的局部步骤。"

msgid "| Starting point | Recommended method | Intended audience |"
msgstr "| 你的起点 | 推荐方式 | 适合人群 |"

msgid ""
"| Need a working environment as quickly as possible | **Pre-built vLLM "
"Ascend image** | Most users; recommended |"
msgstr "| 希望最快得到可用环境 | **预构建 vLLM Ascend 镜像** | 大多数用户，推荐 |"

msgid ""
"| Already have a compatible CANN environment | **Install in an existing CANN"
" environment** | Users familiar with Python/CANN |"
msgstr "| 已经有兼容 CANN 环境 | **在已有 CANN 环境中安装** | 熟悉 Python/CANN 的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| Want to manage the complete userspace software stack | **Build from a base"
" environment** | Advanced users / developers |"
msgstr "| 希望自己管理完整 userspace 软件栈 | **从基础环境构建** | 高级用户 / 开发者 |"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/prebuilt_image.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/prebuilt_image.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/cann_environment.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/cann_environment.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/base_environment.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/base_environment.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "## 5. Advanced Topics {: #installation-advanced }"
msgstr "## 5. 高级主题 {: #installation-advanced }"

msgid ""
"The following sections cover build verification, multi-node environment "
"preparation, and installation troubleshooting."
msgstr "以下内容用于构建检查、多节点环境准备和安装问题定位。"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/cpu_only_build.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/cpu_only_build.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/multi_node.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/multi_node.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/troubleshooting.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/troubleshooting.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "## 6. Installation Complete {: #installation-complete }"
msgstr "## 6. 安装完成 {: #installation-complete }"

msgid ""
"After the host, NPU backend, and vLLM Ascend plugin pass verification, the "
"environment preparation stage is complete."
msgstr "当 Host、NPU backend 和 vLLM Ascend plugin 验证通过后，环境准备阶段结束。"

msgid ""
"Next, proceed to the [Quickstart](quick_start.md), select your hardware, and"
" run your first model inference or start an online service."
msgstr "下一步进入 [Quickstart](quick_start.md)，选择你的硬件并完成第一次模型推理或在线服务。"
